{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Thrilling Catch-Based Combat Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every battle begins with a single catch!<br>Control your flying platform to <strong>catch falling characters mid-air</strong> and unleash their attacks.<br>With enemies and projectiles closing in from all directions, predicting drop trajectories and maneuvering with precision becomes key.<br><strong>One perfect catch can turn the tide of battle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/87aa2919f5c4a37060b4f252b2bfce90.poster.avif?t=1752044789\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/87aa2919f5c4a37060b4f252b2bfce90.webm?t=1752044789\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/87aa2919f5c4a37060b4f252b2bfce90.mp4?t=1752044789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Unique Characters, Strategic Synergy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character brings a <strong>distinct attack style and special skill</strong> to the battlefield.<br>Whether you're grouping enemies for massive AoE, knocking foes away to regain control, or buffing your entire squad\u2014<br><strong>your choice of characters dramatically changes how you play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own team compositions and unleash devastating skill combos tailored to your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/ff6826867da0e009d3b9b959ce8548a5.poster.avif?t=1752044789\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/ff6826867da0e009d3b9b959ce8548a5.webm?t=1752044789\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/extras/ff6826867da0e009d3b9b959ce8548a5.mp4?t=1752044789\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Evolving Builds Through Artifacts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your combat style through powerful artifact upgrades.<br>Each choice dynamically enhances your character\u2014<strong>changing how your skills behave, how attacks land, and how battles unfold.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a growth system where <strong>your build transforms how you fight</strong>, not just how big the numbers get.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3818230?t=1752044789","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3818230?t=1752044789","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/246d3a5fc82dd945ef87d615d9fe58e383c7efc3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752044789","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3818230/246d3a5fc82dd945ef87d615d9fe58e383c7efc3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752044789","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Thrilling Catch-Based Combat Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every battle begins with a single catch!<br>Control your flying platform to <strong>catch falling characters mid-air</strong> and unleash their attacks.<br>With enemies and projectiles closing in from all directions, predicting drop trajectories and maneuvering with precision becomes key.<br><strong>One perfect catch ca